# The corpus's LF convention is MEASURED and asserted in every report's
# validation block. core.autocrlf=true would rewrite LF->CRLF on checkout,
# invalidating every recorded LF count. Pin the text formats explicitly.
*.md   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=lf
*.lock text eol=lf
*.tsv  text eol=lf
